WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.430
We wanted to do a "Firefly" reunion in honor,

2
00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.360
of by the way,

3
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.027
all of us women out there who are missing our girlfriends,

4
00:00:08.027 --> 00:00:13.027
"Firefly" is such an amazing celebration

5
00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:14.400
of female friendship,

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.730
and I was obsessed with the actress who plays you

7
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.720
as the teenage version of Sarah's character.

8
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.064
And we invite her here, please welcome Roan Curtis.

9
00:00:24.064 --> 00:00:25.532
(audience applauds)

10
00:00:25.532 --> 00:00:28.153
Hi.

11
00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.300
Roan I'm so excited to meet you.

12
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.833
I was obsessed with you, watching the show.

13
00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.260
That is the biggest compliment,

14
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.200
I'm so excited to be here.

15
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.763
I was obsessed with you both,

16
00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.930
you both two people make one whole person,

17
00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.963
and your character, Kate,

18
00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.840
you guys learned mannerisms together and practiced together,

19
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.130
is that true?

20
00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.230
Yeah.

21
00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:55.960
I mean, it's funny, I grew up watching "Scrubs"

22
00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:58.590 line:15%
and so for me at least like we work together,

23
00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:01.350 line:15%
but for me I feel like kind of understanding

24
00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.360
Sarah and her mannerisms was quite easy for me

25
00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:07.360
because I spent so much of my life watching her.

26
00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.010
That is helpful.

27
00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:10.740
And you guys are so similar on screen

28
00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:11.800
but I wanted to see

29
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.240
what both of you guys are like offscreen

30
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.770
since I'm such an uberfan of you on screen,

31
00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.430
and I was wondering if you guys would play a game with me

32
00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:22.097
called "Face the Fun Facts".

33
00:01:22.097 --> 00:01:23.194
(upbeat music)

34
00:01:23.194 --> 00:01:26.190
(audience applauding)

35
00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.370
Okay, here's how it works.

36
00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:30.620
A fact is going to go up on the screen and appear

37
00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.620
and I've never seen these fun facts,

38
00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:34.380
so I'm going to guess if the fun fact

39
00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:38.080
is about Sarah or Roan

40
00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:41.040
and the person who it's about will reveal herself

41
00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.670
and explain the fact.

42
00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.600
Sounds great.

43
00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.040
Okay, let's see the first fact.

44
00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.033 line:15%
Kicked out of the choir in the fifth grade.

45
00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:51.943 line:15%
I think it was Sarah.

46
00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:56.540 line:15%
You would be correct it was Mrs McKinnon,

47
00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.572 line:15%
Ah, sorry.

48
00:01:58.572 --> 00:02:02.120 line:15%
And it was basically singing Christmas carols in a mall,

49
00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:03.360 line:15%
not a fancy choir

50
00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.210 line:15%
and Mrs. McKinnon said, Chalke girls

51
00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.910 line:15%
so she lumped in my sister and I together,

52
00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:09.612
could you just mouth the words for this performance?

53
00:02:09.612 --> 00:02:11.610
(audience laughing)

54
00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:12.730
I love that.

55
00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:13.563
I love that story.

56
00:02:13.563 --> 00:02:14.396
Perfect visual.

57
00:02:14.396 --> 00:02:15.920
Okay the next one,

58
00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:19.733 line:15%
wore matching outfits with mom on Mother's Day.

59
00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.703 line:15%
I'm going with Roan on this one.

60
00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.580 line:15%
You would be correct.

61
00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.646 line:15%
(bell ringing)

62
00:02:28.646 --> 00:02:29.658 line:15%
Dude.

63
00:02:29.658 --> 00:02:31.303 line:15%
Yeah, you're two for two.

64
00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.360
So it was Mother's Day and we, it was accidental,

65
00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.100
we just like showed up and we met each other.

66
00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.970
We didn't even notice that we were wearing matching outfits,

67
00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.580 line:15%
and then we bumped into somebody walking down the street

68
00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:44.410 line:15%
and they were like, oh, you're matching outfits.

69
00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:46.697 line:15%
And we were like, we are?

70
00:02:46.697 --> 00:02:50.000
And so then we've decided to take a picture.

71
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.023
Oh, that's so sweet.

72
00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.820
My daughter kicked me in the shins this morning.

73
00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.653
Okay.

74
00:02:58.084 --> 00:02:58.917
It's the truth.

75
00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:00.893
Okay.

76
00:03:00.893 --> 00:03:01.726
Next fun fact.

77
00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.823 line:15%
Okay, can write with her feet.

78
00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.623 line:15%
I'm going to Sarah.

79
00:03:13.227 --> 00:03:14.060 line:15%
(bell ringing)

80
00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:14.926 line:15%
Three for three.

81
00:03:14.926 --> 00:03:15.910 line:15%
Dudes!

82
00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:16.970 line:15%
I'm so excited.

83
00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.570
See this is how I am with my girlfriends,

84
00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:19.613
I call them dudes.

85
00:03:20.553 --> 00:03:23.560 line:15%
We were in grade six, I think,

86
00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:26.360 line:15%
and I was passing notes in class and getting in trouble,

87
00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:28.000 line:15%
and so then I just wrote the note under the desk

88
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.770
'cause I, I mean you can imagine

89
00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:33.130
have very unattractive long toes, if that's possible.

90
00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:37.770
But how like inventive, okay.

91
00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:41.330
Walks a cat outside in a cat pack.

92
00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:42.990 line:15%
I'm going Roan.

93
00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:43.985 line:15%
Oh yeah.

94
00:03:43.985 --> 00:03:45.610 line:15%
(bell ringing)

95
00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:49.280 line:15%
Okay, so I got it before we went into lockdown

96
00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.430
and it was kind of like a joke,

97
00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.027
like I bought it for myself being like,

98
00:03:52.027 --> 00:03:54.220
I'd like to take Gremlin, my cat out for walks

99
00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:56.080
and that was like once or twice,

100
00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:59.220
and then lockdown hits and I have nothing to do

101
00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:03.190
but take my cat out for walks in a backpack.

102
00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.140
And now I'm known as the lady

103
00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.450
who walks around my neighborhood

104
00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:07.923
with the yellow cat backpack.

105
00:04:07.923 --> 00:04:09.450
(audience laughing)

106
00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:10.283
All right.

107
00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:13.540 line:15%
The last fact is really good at limbo,

108
00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.803 line:15%
I'm going Sarah with this one.

109
00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.290 line:15%
Okay, so interestingly enough,

110
00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:24.140 line:15%
you are right and also it's wrong too.

111
00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.160 line:15%
We both have this crazy,

112
00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.360 line:15%
like it was so weird in the show,

113
00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.650 line:15%
we sort of found that we have all these similar mannerisms

114
00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:32.210
and we kind of both love to dance,

115
00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.550
and have a lot of similar interests,

116
00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:37.210
but we both have our like our secret kind of superpower

117
00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.523
is limbo for both of us.

118
00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.063
Oh wow, that's low.

119
00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.800
We got pretty low.

120
00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.720
I honestly, I think Sarah was better at it than I was.

121
00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.160
I think like I fell,

122
00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.429
I don't know if you can kind of see it at the end there,

123
00:04:51.429 --> 00:04:53.110
but I like fall kind of like onto my, onto all fours,

124
00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:57.150
and she like kept going, like she was on it.

125
00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:00.240
Yeah, Sarah, you're like full bend.

126
00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.860
I don't know when I'm going to learn my lesson,

127
00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.210
this is something that I love to do,

128
00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:05.810
and I've always loved to do but,

129
00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:10.040
it's turned into a foot ankle injury situation,

130
00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.150
and I've had to go to the doctor twice now

131
00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:13.450
and they said so how did you do this?

132
00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.330
And I'm like, limbo again.

133
00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:17.500
Well, you know, listen,

134
00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.150 line:15%
you've got writing to do with those feet,

135
00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:22.770 line:15%
you've got paddle boarding and crabs to catch,

136
00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:25.120 line:15%
so just take care of that body of yours,

137
00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.230
'Cause it seems like you know how to embrace life

138
00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:30.160
and have a good time,

139
00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:32.370 line:15%
and I just want to thank you Sarah and Roan

140
00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:37.370 line:15%
so much for joining me and giving us all a taste of

141
00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:41.570
what it's like to have the female experience

142
00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.560
and all the friendship that goes with it,

143
00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.610
and so thank you,

144
00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.530
I just am such a "Firefly Lane" fan.

145
00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.860
Thank you ladies so much.

146
00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.060
And of course, "Eat Wheaties!"

147
00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.870
will be in theater and demand.

148
00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:56.930
This Friday, April 30th is when it drops,

149
00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:00.340
so check that out and "Firefly Lane"

150
00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:01.550
if you haven't already seen it,

151
00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:05.370
it was number one on Netflix, but it's still on Netflix,

152
00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.460
so thank you so much for coming today.

153
00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.133 line:15%
I really, really appreciate it.

154
00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:12.657 line:15%
(upbeat music)

